# 9. Mapeo conceptual BIAN → RAIA

Utiliza el siguiente mapeo para organizar el portal:

| Concepto de inspiración                       | Módulo RAIA                                 |
| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| Information Architecture                      | RAIA Information Architecture               |
| Control Record Model                          | RAIA Control Record Model                   |
| Business Object Model                         | RAIA Business Object Model                  |
| Banking Industry Architecture Reference Model | AFORE Industry Architecture Reference Model |
| Service Domain Landscape                      | RAIA Service Domain Landscape               |
| Value Chain View                              | RAIA Value Chain View                       |
| Matrix View                                   | RAIA Matrix View                            |
| Overview Diagrams                             | RAIA Overview Diagrams                      |
| Business Scenarios                            | RAIA Business Scenarios                     |
| Scenario Snippets                             | RAIA Reusable Scenario Snippets             |
| Business Capability Map                       | RAIA Business Capability Map                |
| MetaModel Overview                            | RAIA Metamodel Overview                     |
| Wireframes Overview                           | RAIA Architecture Wireframes                |
| Dashboard                                     | RAIA Architecture Dashboard                 |
| Contribution                                  | Contribuir a RAIA                           |
| No equivalente central                        | RAIA Regulatory Architecture                |

Este mapeo es conceptual.

No copies contenido bancario.

